
        revised_prompt: |-
          Create a whimsical, child-friendly storybook illustration of a pink axolotl underwater in a clear, twilight pond. The axolotl’s feathery external gills glow softly, swirling tiny points of light that form constellation-like patterns in the water. Above, lily pads float on a glassy surface reflecting stars and a crescent moon; below, pond plants sway gently. Around the axolotl, small tadpoles and minnows watch in awe—each tadpole bears a single tiny glowing star on its back. Use a dreamy watercolor-and-ink style with soft teals, violets, and warm gold highlights; include gentle caustic light beams and a cozy, magical mood. High resolution, clean composition with a slight paper texture.

          Include this exact two-sentence caption as elegant, readable hand-lettered text centered at the bottom of the image (no typos):
          At midnight, a curious axolotl stitched constellations into the pond’s dark surface with the gentle swish of her feathery gills. By dawn, each tadpole carried a tiny star on its back, and the water remembered all their names.
